    "q-276897": {
      "dom_id": "step-q276897",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Rationalize the denominator of the following expression:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"40\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\" align=\"center\">$\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{pq}}\\,=\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"40\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">{{field-1}}\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"40\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"40\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">$pq$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
      "worked_solution": "First, we apply the quotient rule and put the numerator and denominator under separate radicals:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{pq}} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{\\sqrt{pq}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we need to remove the radical $\\sqrt{pq}$ from the denominator. To do this, we multiply both the numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{pq},$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{\\sqrt{pq}}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{pq}}{\\sqrt{pq}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{11pq}}{(\\sqrt{pq})^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{11pq}}{pq}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:60px;\n                                        margin-left:1px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"15\"><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"17\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 0.943478);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"19\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"18\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"20\">1</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"22\">p</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"24\">q</var></span></span></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "√11pq",
